Researchers also introduced AlphaEVAL, a production-grounded benchmark of 94 real tasks sourced from

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:12.460
seven companies deploying AI agents. It covers six ONET occupational domains and evaluates complete

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:17.820
agent products against implicit constraints, heterogeneous documents, and evolving expert standards.

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:23.240
Unlike synthetic benchmarks, this one reflects actual deployment pain. The accompanying

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:28.240
requirement to benchmark framework helps organizations rapidly convert authentic production

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:34.500
