uncensored 27 billion parameter class model on something like an RTX 3060. Run AlphaEval style

00:09:23.480 --> 00:09:29.180
evaluations on your own deployed agents using the new requirement to benchmark construction framework.

00:09:29.640 --> 00:09:35.100
It dramatically shortens the gap between lab benchmarks and production reality. Experiment with

