thought retriever on long academic PDFs or internal knowledge bases. Watch how the self-evolving

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:46.560
thought memory improves over successive queries. Compare radial consensus score against majority voting

00:09:46.560 --> 00:09:51.520
on your existing best-of-end pipelines. You can implement the fresh A mean ranking in under 50 lines

00:09:51.520 --> 00:09:57.740
and measure gains on long-form reasoning tasks. On the horizon, expect broader ecosystem adoption of

